        "ru-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "939a65dd-27e8-3327-ae9e-46687b8060a0",
                "word": "невольно",
                "pos": "adv",
                "lang_code": "ru",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ad0f3bc9-497b-3133-a93e-e28cfcc8005c",
                        "entry_id": "939a65dd-27e8-3327-ae9e-46687b8060a0",
                        "glosses": [
                            "наречие к невольный; непреднамеренно, нечаянно, случайно"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "adverb"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5e86ae07-5b2a-4e20-9585-2e07a5859729",
                                "sense_id": "ad0f3bc9-497b-3133-a93e-e28cfcc8005c",
                                "text": "— Ах! — невольно вырвалось у меня."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8204aabe-f0e6-4c43-adf8-0b9049ed63b3",
                                "sense_id": "ad0f3bc9-497b-3133-a93e-e28cfcc8005c",
                                "text": "Но вдруг мне попал в руки листок прескверной, скомканной бумаги, на котором невольно остановилось моё внимание."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0282a4db-a889-4f9a-9df0-e63b5ea74f75",
                                "sense_id": "ad0f3bc9-497b-3133-a93e-e28cfcc8005c",
                                "text": "Услыхав шум платья и лёгких шагов уже в дверях, она оглянулась, и на измученном лице её невольно выразилось не радость, а удивление."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4ca1565f-e16b-45b3-b79f-e03f0b7e1382",
                                "sense_id": "ad0f3bc9-497b-3133-a93e-e28cfcc8005c",
                                "text": "Она пристально ждала и ловила его взгляд: не выдерживая упорно направленного на него взгляда, Алеша нет-нет и вдруг невольно, непреодолимою силой, взглядывал на неё сам, и тотчас же она усмехалась торжествующею улыбкой прямо ему в глаза."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5f70ebe1-b70c-4441-be25-377bf60450af",
                                "sense_id": "ad0f3bc9-497b-3133-a93e-e28cfcc8005c",
                                "text": "Игра как раз кончилась, и когда он поднялся с места, невольно встретился глазами с двумя шептавшимися почтенными старичками, которые сейчас же замолчали."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4e2ddfdf-b662-32b3-970e-7e5b0559c9d5",
                        "entry_id": "939a65dd-27e8-3327-ae9e-46687b8060a0",
                        "glosses": [
                            "непроизвольно, бессознательно"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ccafd95f-5476-4d99-bcbd-c33c4aed7935",
                                "sense_id": "4e2ddfdf-b662-32b3-970e-7e5b0559c9d5",
                                "text": "Когда же граф, в изысканных выражениях, извинился в том, что промедлил, и мы тоже заняли места на ветхих, изъеденных вековой сыростью скамьях, я различил в другом углу неопределённый призрак шеста с перекладиной и верёвкой и, поняв, что это — дыба, невольно нащупал эфес своей верной шпаги."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6bd6caa8-fcbf-3a1c-a4ed-53ad650e5d79",
                        "entry_id": "939a65dd-27e8-3327-ae9e-46687b8060a0",
                        "glosses": [
                            "независимо от собственного желания, собственной воле; вынужденно"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "697cf859-c0d1-4bde-bd73-e40a5602f547",
                                "sense_id": "6bd6caa8-fcbf-3a1c-a4ed-53ad650e5d79",
                                "text": "Больше всего шумели насчет подслушивания те, кто вольно или невольно «постукивал» в инстанции о настроениях в редакции."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c5287ced-d93a-41d4-ae92-8fd518ff3df3",
                        "source_entry_id": "939a65dd-27e8-3327-ae9e-46687b8060a0",
                        "target_lang_word": "involuntarily",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "involuntarily",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "072a53f4-2a46-3acb-8b4c-9cbfdf81b308",
                                        "entry_id": "1315d253-080d-3acb-bf02-852c79a2b310",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In an involuntary manner; done without conscious thought."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "61a5c59d-651c-446a-a797-4ad0070ff0bf",
                                                "sense_id": "072a53f4-2a46-3acb-8b4c-9cbfdf81b308",
                                                "text": "Her leg twitched involuntarily."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "59581903-2382-4bd1-98f8-559a0112b0b8",
                                                "sense_id": "072a53f4-2a46-3acb-8b4c-9cbfdf81b308",
                                                "text": "He involuntarily overheard the conversation."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a5559fe0-e6d3-4289-824a-c0569ed162ad",
                                                "sense_id": "072a53f4-2a46-3acb-8b4c-9cbfdf81b308",
                                                "text": "His eyes filled with tears, as he took up the glittering lengths. Their pale gold was lovely as ever; but there was something in the touch from which he involuntarily recoiled."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0d204e97-0f65-433a-8d57-b5f9f95f53f1",
                                                "sense_id": "072a53f4-2a46-3acb-8b4c-9cbfdf81b308",
                                                "text": "Kennedy’s vocal rasp is not caused by an infection or respiratory condition. Instead, he has spasmodic dysphonia, a rare neurological condition in which the muscles that open and close his vocal cords spasm involuntarily, creating a strained or strangled quality to his speech."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7b70ce25-5e0a-40fe-8ba9-941496f8a551",
                        "source_entry_id": "939a65dd-27e8-3327-ae9e-46687b8060a0",
                        "target_lang_word": "automatically",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "automatically",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "04d7c71e-bbe5-340e-af56-18a90cee3f66",
                                        "entry_id": "ad5526a1-a56e-32b9-828d-16e8a0297a58",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In an automatic manner."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "60fb9eb0-45b8-44c5-a612-d45ba053f72e",
                                                "sense_id": "04d7c71e-bbe5-340e-af56-18a90cee3f66",
                                                "text": "The mere existence of a dictionary of a certain variety of English does not automatically confer acceptance of that variety."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bb1341be-8bf8-4be4-8263-72bf9661f38f",
                                                "sense_id": "04d7c71e-bbe5-340e-af56-18a90cee3f66",
                                                "text": "The Social Security Administration announced Friday that it will no longer automatically withhold 100% of the overpayment amount from recipients’ monthly benefits. Instead, it will collect 10% – or $10, whichever is greater – to recover the overpayment."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "08e52169-742c-4982-b746-392ee05b2fdb",
                        "source_entry_id": "939a65dd-27e8-3327-ae9e-46687b8060a0",
                        "target_lang_word": "unintentionally",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "unintentionally",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "289a2ef5-e857-33d6-aa41-7f0747ec2302",
                                        "entry_id": "585a2102-23e1-3dc7-804c-c7fbf7681d14",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Without meaning to, in an unintentional manner, not intentionally."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ca6a6d27-2726-48d0-8851-9e40fe37ce8a",
                                                "sense_id": "289a2ef5-e857-33d6-aa41-7f0747ec2302",
                                                "text": "\"Oh, no! Mason will not defy me; nor knowing it, will he hurt me—but, unintentionally, he might in a moment, by one careless word, deprive me, if not of life, yet for ever of happiness.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f5b7c20f-4244-4994-976e-56f71062fddd",
                                                "sense_id": "289a2ef5-e857-33d6-aa41-7f0747ec2302",
                                                "text": "And, even if you do not unintentionally overstore your markets, over-expansion by your competitors will produce similar effects."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "28f1df98-f2cb-40f8-b66c-ad66f03ca4c3",
                        "source_entry_id": "939a65dd-27e8-3327-ae9e-46687b8060a0",
                        "target_lang_word": "unwittingly",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "unwittingly",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "91382d24-d664-3a30-80ef-7721967eeaa8",
                                        "entry_id": "573b8841-7e27-3f2c-86f7-9dcb24979614",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In an unwitting manner; inadvertently, obliviously, unintentionally, unknowingly."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1ce41931-cc59-4605-8945-9f98cde73c16",
                                                "sense_id": "91382d24-d664-3a30-80ef-7721967eeaa8",
                                                "text": "She realized to her horror that she had unwittingly helped those people she most despised."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f0e853b3-e7c9-4346-9be0-7d2cfb061044",
                                                "sense_id": "91382d24-d664-3a30-80ef-7721967eeaa8",
                                                "text": "This morning, / Paprs of State he ſent me, to peruſe / As I required: and wot you what I found / There (on my Conſcience put vnwittingly) […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "85b22c18-59d8-4329-9cab-9a1c914ba7fc",
                                                "sense_id": "91382d24-d664-3a30-80ef-7721967eeaa8",
                                                "text": "[O]nly now it remained that I inquire whether I have right to enter the city of refuge: so I found, that he must not, who lay in wait to shed blood: It was not the wilful murderer, but he who unwittingly did it, he who did it unawares; not out of spite, or grudge, or malice, he that shed it unwittingly: even he who did not hate his neighbour before. Wherefore, […] I thought verily I was the man that must enter, because I had smitten my neighbour unwittingly, and hated Him not aforetime."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c2608d3a-3547-4ab7-bba2-4e4a0e0b6629",
                                                "sense_id": "91382d24-d664-3a30-80ef-7721967eeaa8",
                                                "text": "I have had a deep sense of the sad consequences of mistakes, in things capital; and their impossibility of recovering when compleated; and what grief of heart it brings to a tender conscience, to have been unwittingly encouraging of the sufferings of the innocent."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "13d63ee2-50e7-44e5-8965-07926841c249",
                                                "sense_id": "91382d24-d664-3a30-80ef-7721967eeaa8",
                                                "text": "Of course those ministers who did support this did so unwittingly in most instances, did they not? By unwittingly I mean not knowing that the whole program was controlled and dominated and instigated by the Communist Party."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "09af7b6b-a23c-4abc-8c98-ff04cf0b635d",
                                                "sense_id": "91382d24-d664-3a30-80ef-7721967eeaa8",
                                                "text": "In the fall of 2016, [Hugh] Hefner was the subject of rumors about his health. As per his wishes, he was to be buried in a crypt next to that of Marilyn Monroe, who'd unwittingly helped launch Playboy into the multi-million-dollar business it became."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ee5a6782-df6e-412f-8dca-919d37275255",
                                                "sense_id": "91382d24-d664-3a30-80ef-7721967eeaa8",
                                                "text": "\"She had asked at Paddington for a return to Lympstone on the Exmouth branch, where her son was due to pass out as a Royal Marine that afternoon, at the local training camp.\n\"Presumably, the booking clerk had misheard her and sold her a ticket to Leominster, and other helpful staff had unwittingly helped her on her way."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "91b0342e-303e-4fad-860a-013e220603ec",
                                                "sense_id": "91382d24-d664-3a30-80ef-7721967eeaa8",
                                                "text": "Germany is a nation on the brink. On Tuesday, perhaps unwittingly, a handful of members of parliament decided to see how much further they could push it."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "8d90428c-4ccb-4ee0-9791-88e068e526cb",
                        "source_entry_id": "939a65dd-27e8-3327-ae9e-46687b8060a0",
                        "target_lang_word": "instintivamente",
                        "target_lang_code": "es",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d07f6a9c-fba9-42e7-86db-fc9f0543e972",
                        "source_entry_id": "939a65dd-27e8-3327-ae9e-46687b8060a0",
                        "target_lang_word": "involontairement",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "involontairement",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9e528f08-3dd7-3dd2-9d50-48cf82bd402f",
                                        "entry_id": "7a693b80-fa4e-3f1e-9b11-2cb8aa834bf3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Sans le vouloir."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3b46d510-27b0-43eb-b7b9-3676a89a8f8e",
                                                "sense_id": "9e528f08-3dd7-3dd2-9d50-48cf82bd402f",
                                                "text": "Il laissa Rébecca en la société de la vieille femme, à qui elle avait été ainsi involontairement imposée."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5ca474d6-8842-4342-ad76-5dbf4c3d9306",
                                                "sense_id": "9e528f08-3dd7-3dd2-9d50-48cf82bd402f",
                                                "text": "Sans doute une des lanternes qui, heurtée involontairement contre la muraille, avait pirouetté sur elle-même et présenté en arrière la vitre lumineuse."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "40df1d1d-1359-45fc-8a64-c3177cdc84db",
                                                "sense_id": "9e528f08-3dd7-3dd2-9d50-48cf82bd402f",
                                                "text": "Comme la plupart des jeunes femmes réellement innocentes et sans expérience, elle voyait une faute dans un amour involontairement inspiré à un homme."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3a515acd-44ef-43e6-ac49-926208458bc4",
                        "source_entry_id": "939a65dd-27e8-3327-ae9e-46687b8060a0",
